#=====================================================================
# gui_evwifi.NX500 — the single filter entry, nxui menu (EN)
#=====================================================================
# EV+WiFi opens this page. EV+AEL is free again (community script).
#
# Both filter layers live in ONE panel: LUT and FilmLab are tabs at the top
# of the same window, switchable at any time. One key combo instead of three.
#
# Switching layers happens in-process (`filter:lut` / `filter:pw` are
# pseudo-commands nxui understands). The old `nxui.sh switch <mode>` killed
# the panel and started another one: a one-second black screen, and
# `pidof nxui.arm` matched the exiting process itself, which made the panel
# die and never come back. Now it only swaps the list — same process, same
# window, same focus.
#
# Format: button|label|command   /  @ prefix = open submenu (same renderer)
# Keep labels within 6 full-width chars. 6 entries = one nxui menu page.
#=====================================================================

button|LUT Filter|filter:lut
button|FilmLab|filter:pw
button|V-Log Curve|@/opt/usr/nx-ks/gui_vlog.NX500

button|Functions|@/opt/usr/nx-ks/gui_func.NX500
button|GO BACK|@/opt/usr/nx-ks/gui_ini.NX500
button|CANCEL|/opt/usr/nx-ks/gui_exit.sh
